3 preempt t=1 P1 [P1 0 5 10 15 20 25 CPU P1 slice over Ready queue P1 +0 Process Arrival Arr Burst Status State Waiting Wait Turnaround Turn Response Resp P1 0 2 waiting 0 — — P2 1 20 pending — — — P3 2 1 pending — — — P4 3 1 pending — — — P5 4 1 pending — — — P6 5 1 pending — — — P7 6 1 pending — — — Current time CPU idle New time slice] {P1's slice is over. It still needs 1 unit of burst and goes to the back of the ready queue, where it is the only process waiting.}
