exports[`scheduling board readout > reads the same on starvation under round-robin-q6 1`] = `
"0 ready t=0 - [0 5 10 15 20 25 CPU waiting to start Ready queue empty Process Arrival Arr Burst Status State Waiting Wait Turnaround Turn Response Resp P1 0 2 pending — — — P2 1 20 pending — — — P3 2 1 pending — — — P4 3 1 pending — — — P5 4 1 pending — — — P6 5 1 pending — — — P7 6 1 pending — — — Current time CPU idle New time slice] {Ready to schedule 7 processes with a quantum of 6 units.}
1 arrive t=0 P1 [0 5 10 15 20 25 CPU free Ready queue P1 +0 Process Arrival Arr Burst Status State Waiting Wait Turnaround Turn Response Resp P1 0 2 waiting 0 — — P2 1 20 pending — — — P3 2 1 pending — — — P4 3 1 pending — — — P5 4 1 pending — — — P6 5 1 pending — — — P7 6 1 pending — — — Current time CPU idle New time slice] {P1 arrives and finds the CPU free.}
2 run t=0 P1 [P1 0 5 10 15 20 25 CPU P1 2 units left Ready queue empty Process Arrival Arr Burst Status State Waiting Wait Turnaround Turn Response Resp P1 0 2 running 0 — — P2 1 20 pending — — — P3 2 1 pending — — — P4 3 1 pending — — — P5 4 1 pending — — — P6 5 1 pending — — — P7 6 1 pending — — — Current time CPU idle New time slice] {P1 takes the CPU for the first time, after waiting 0 units. Its slice is up to 6 units.}
